Movie Recommendation System

This project builds a recommendation system that suggests movies based on a user's preferences. You can implement either Content-Based Filtering (using movie genres) or Collaborative Filtering (using user ratings).

1. Content-Based Filtering (Genre-Based)
How It Works
Each movie has attributes such as genres, keywords, or descriptions.
The system finds movies similar to those a user likes.
Similarity is calculated using techniques like TF-IDF and Cosine Similarity.
